0231: the vsync tick re-anchored to the panel's refreshes: when 0230 sees a flush taken, a refresh began; the tick follows sweetvsync_lead us (500) after it instead of running free, so the window server's frames start right after a refresh. sweetvsync_lock=0: free-running as before.

